				""
				"随着你靠近，你开始辨认出两个身影。一个似乎是&d教授&r；另一个应该就是&c鲍勃&r。游泳有点困难，但你还是设法游到了他们身边。"
				""
				"You're able to sneak up on &cBob&r, notice his eerie purple cloak, and wonder why he didn't take it off before going under the ocean. You quickly take &cBob&r out by wrapping the cloak around his head, the moment you verify he has passed, he explodes into purple energy; a glowing purple object is all that remains in his place. Despite it being a little soft and gooey, you just cram it into your pocket."
